  "releaseNotes": "Adds built-in OpenTelemetry instrumentation (System.Diagnostics.Metrics and ActivitySource) across all core services, workflows, and the ingestion/search/index-rebuild paths via the Lattice.Core.Telemetry namespace. Emit rides the .NET base class library and is a no-op until a host subscribes to the \"Lattice.Core\" meter and activity source, so there is no new package dependency. See TELEMETRY.md.",
